  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1133436566744858644/vr_combat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1124\" height=\"154\"></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=b164bd&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/elocindev/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Check out my mods!&color=393939&labelColor=b164bd&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" width=\"203\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=SUPPORTS&message=FABRIC 1.19.2&color=393939&labelColor=b164bd&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"231\" height=\"29\"></strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Support&color=393939&labelColor=b164bd&style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Требуется <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vivecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vivecraft</a> и <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>О МОДЕ</strong></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">VR Combat добавляет совместимость между Vivecraft и Better Combat.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Позволяет игрокам в VR и без VR играть вместе без проблем, переопределяя боевую систему только для пользователей VR.</p>",
